{"type":"standard","title":"Lauren Boebert","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lauren Boebert</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q96761544","titles":{"canonical":"Lauren_Boebert","normalized":"Lauren Boebert","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lauren Boebert</span></span>"},"pageid":64429315,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f4/Lauren_Boebert_117th_U.S_Congress_%283x4_cropped%29_%282%29.jpg/330px-Lauren_Boebert_117th_U.S_Congress_%283x4_cropped%29_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":387},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Lauren_Boebert_117th_U.S_Congress_%283x4_cropped%29_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1931,"height":2262},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376262641","tid":"841f8a1b-b6f8-11f1-823f-27e85f4d3577","timestamp":"2026-09-23T02:43:11Z","description":"American politician (born 1986)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Boebert","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Boebert?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Boebert?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lauren_Boebert"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Boebert","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lauren_Boebert","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lauren_Boebert?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lauren_Boebert"}},"extract":"Lauren Opal Boebert is an American politician, businesswoman, and gun rights activist serving as the U.S. representative for Colorado's 4th congressional district beginning in 2025, having previously represented Colorado's 3rd congressional district from 2021 to 2025. From 2013 to 2022, she owned Shooters Grill, a restaurant in Rifle, Colorado, where staff members were encouraged to carry firearms openly.","extract_html":"<p><b>Lauren Opal Boebert</b> is an American politician, businesswoman, and gun rights activist serving as the U.S. representative for Colorado's 4th congressional district beginning in 2025, having previously represented Colorado's 3rd congressional district from 2021 to 2025. From 2013 to 2022, she owned Shooters Grill, a restaurant in Rifle, Colorado, where staff members were encouraged to carry firearms openly.</p>"}